          ],
          "content": "2. Find the degree measures of different angles in your classroom using your protractor."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.44,
            0.757,
            0.609,
            0.777
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Teacher’s Note"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.779,
